Swift note is a calm, tactile handwriting and PDF annotation application built on
a hybrid C++20/GTK3 and Rust architecture, forked from Xournal++ (1.3.8+dev).
It targets Windows 10/11 and GNU/Linux (Wayland & X11) while preserving 100%
compatibility with the open .xopp document format.
.
Swift note features:
.
 - 3 switchable solid-opaque layouts (Pure Top Bar, Canvas Pill, Zen Bottom Dock)
 - Non-destructive Blackboard mode with chroma-preserving ink inversion & dual PDF export
 - Quick Pen Slots, Auto-Return Eraser, and Scrble Ink-style single-key shortcuts
 - Close-Up auto-advance magnified writing strip and Cornell Notes template
 - Vietnamese diacritic-insensitive notebook library with instant preview extraction
 - Lossless Rust clipboard PNG/DIB image pipeline
 - Full Xournal++ stylus pressure, Setsquare, Compass, LaTeX, Audio & PDF annotation engine
